" label="lyrics-like">uodcúmque fácitis, ex ánimo¡ Dómino accipiétis retributiónem</l><l xml:id="m-37ab801e-cbf0-4ceb-b60c-cfdbd7f4c6a7" facs="#m-404f6498-61f2-4864-873c-9679b538b3e8" label="lyrics-like">Dómino Christo</l><l xml:id="m-08319961-aaae-4345-b8bf-feb65119751e" facs="#m-3c664ac1-b752-4f9f-91e0-bea77672dc6c" label="lyrics-like">L operámini sicut Dómino, et hereditátis.</l><l xml:id="m-3567ba2e-4a69-4e93-8999-0870d56b54a8" facs="#m-4665e431-1e7a-4c09-ad68-298ccf34c5b9" label="lyrics-like">non hominibus, ! sciéntes quod a servite.</l><l xml:id="m-d193ea29-f7e1-4dbc-a9c9-5fdfceb000d5" facs="#m-b01cf970-bd5e-4d14-b8b5-3a6ba0b33665" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-74fa82da-148f-486b-b1b8-0b53cf632024" facs="#m-34c49c8b-16bf-4092-98ec-00728f57204b" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-1bd68f08-59f0-4189-a58d-e09d5deadfe2" facs="#m-e4ca6293-3c07-48ec-bcdf-5dd3993c5e8d" label="lyrics-like">Erbum Dé-i, per quod fácta sunt ómni-a, *Alle¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
